30	/**
31	 * Send the customer to Stripe's hosted setup page.
32	 *
33	 * `startCardSetup` returns a URL, so this is a full navigation rather than a
34	 * fetch — the same shape as `AddFunds`, and the reason no card data ever reaches
35	 * this origin.
